mux Agent OS 中枢
  arch: 三层模型
    读（视图）: dfleet/dstatus status/list inspect
    写（工具）: send/envelope capture/paste split/unsplit remark/auto
    控（驾驶）: drive/wait interrupt/clear/recover
    通讯层: agent register/send/inbox hook on/off/fire
  modules
    types.ts: IMultiplexerBackend Result<T,E> FrameAnalysis WindowDigest FleetDigest
    fleet-analyzer.ts: 14 regex centralized digestFleet analyzeFrame formatDigestRow
    mux.ts: 5647 loc CLI+TUI+backend+drive+bus+hook
    test-mux.sh: smoke test read-only assertions
  verbs: 36 in 10 groups
    维护: help doctor dev install-tmux install-rmux
    车队视图: status list dfleet dstatus
    窗口工具: inspect capture send envelope paste split unsplit
    主动驾驶: drive wait interrupt clear recover
    Agent总线: register unregister send inbox wait list
    事件Hook: on off list fire
    Session/Window: new-session new-window rename kill-window
    用户选项: remark auto
    服务: serve
  backend: rmux(default) tmux(fallback)
  key patterns
    paste-buffer: zero-escaping no TUI char-splitting
    submit-verify: codex/cursor auto-Enter composer-clear-check
    grace-gate: no false-idle must-see-busy-first
    slow-model: GLM/Reasoning 9min+ --timeout 1800
  agent coverage: 9 types
    comm-match: claude node cursor codex reasonix2 pi buddy aider hermes
    frame-fallback: cursor bash-comm ↦ → prompt
    exclude: shell vim htop lazygit
  philosophy
    shared reality: who-doing-what evidence-where blocked-on-what
    evidence loop: no-completion-without-proof
    small steps: auditable reversible state transitions
    responsibility boundary: no-work-without-ownership
  future: WorkItem state machine
    idle→assigned→in-progress→done(with-evidence)→verified(manual)
    timeout→unassigned
